concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-harming-australians-act-2015-sch-1-sec-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 After subsection 115.2(1) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (1A) If the conduct constituting an offence against subsection (1) was engaged in before 1 October 2002, the offence is punishable on conviction by: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00163  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 163, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Harming Australians) Act 2015  (a) if, at the time the conduct was engaged in, the offence mentioned in paragraph (1)(e) was punishable on conviction by imprisonment for a term of less than 25 years—a maximum penalty of imprisonment for a term of not more than that term; or  (b) otherwise—a maximum penalty of imprisonment for a term of not more than 25 years.  (1B) If the conduct constituting an offence against subsection (1) was engaged in on or after 1 October 2002, the offence is punishable on conviction by a maximum penalty of imprisonment for a term of not more than 25 years." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (1A) If the conduct constituting an offence against subsection (1) was engaged in before 1 October 2002, the offence is punishable on conviction by: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00163  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 163, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Harming Australians) Act 2015  (a) if, at the time the conduct was engaged in, the offence mentioned in paragraph (1)(e) was punishable on conviction by imprisonment for a term of less than 25 years—a maximum penalty of imprisonment for a term of not more than that term; or  (b) otherwise—a maximum penalty of imprisonment for a term of not more than 25 years.  (1B) If the conduct constituting an offence against subsection (1) was engaged in on or after 1 October 2002, the offence is punishable on conviction by a maximum penalty of imprisonment for a term of not more than 25 years."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-harming-australians-act-2015-sch-1-sec-12-ss-1a ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-harming-australians-act-2015-sch-1-sec-12-ss-1b ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
