doc:sch-1-sec-14 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "14 At the end of section 115.2 of the Criminal Code" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (3) If:  (a) a person has been convicted or acquitted of an offence in respect of conduct under a law of a foreign country or a part of a foreign country; and  (b) the person engaged in the conduct before 1 October 2002; the person cannot be convicted of an offence against this section in respect of that conduct.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— Senate on 15 October 2015 House of Representatives on 23 November 2015]  (185/15) ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00163" ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer .